    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/d51ad381732df1ba78412d23019bae14.avif?t=1750034416\" width=800 height=291 /></span><strong>100 Men vs 1 Gorilla</strong> is a chaotic <strong><i>100-player online multiplayer</i></strong> game where a single Gorilla faces off against a hundred battle-crying humans. Will teamwork and sheer numbers win, or will the gorilla turn the arena into a banana-scented bloodbath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to 100 Men vs 1 Gorilla: the ultimate test to <strong>settle the debate once and for all</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/f3469b718ce713ee8e00379144ad1bc5.poster.avif?t=1750034416\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/f3469b718ce713ee8e00379144ad1bc5.webm?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/f3469b718ce713ee8e00379144ad1bc5.mp4?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/01766be1fc2144f7a5199cf62d62459f.avif?t=1750034416\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8d <strong>100 and 1 Multiplayer</strong><br>Play as the unstoppable gorilla or one of 100 brave, poorly coordinated humans. Team up with strangers or friends in an all-out war against the mighty Silverback Gorilla.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>High intensity Combat with unique Abilities and Heroes!</strong><br>Can 200 fists defeat a Gorilla or is the Gorilla too strong for 100 tiny human men? It's all out mayhem with high intensity combat. Select one of many heroes, with each their own unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b4b70d26f74f0d4bb0d2781b4597664a.poster.avif?t=1750034416\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b4b70d26f74f0d4bb0d2781b4597664a.webm?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b4b70d26f74f0d4bb0d2781b4597664a.mp4?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/d40ab034c59b3ab36dd316a7e87af117.avif?t=1750034416\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy multiple funny game modes with the 100 Men Vs 1 Gorilla cast, ranging from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Men Vs 1 Gorilla</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Gorilla Free-for-All</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Men Free-for-All</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the mountain Royale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorilla Obstacle Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one Gorilla spot the Fake Gorillas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simon (Gorilla) Says</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/ccce15764491f4b08592caace1b50119.avif?t=1750034416\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress to impress\u2014or confuse. From banana underwear and Poop stained costumes to birds nests, traffic cones, and tin foil hats, customize your Human (or Gorilla) with the most ridiculous drip imaginable. Style means nothing. But it <i>feels</i> like everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/ded657125f77d381cab64bd6c101b55e.poster.avif?t=1750034416\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/ded657125f77d381cab64bd6c101b55e.webm?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/ded657125f77d381cab64bd6c101b55e.mp4?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/3d92fe56f8e4a239de5b537e1da0cc68.avif?t=1750034416\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for chaos, fueled by memes. <strong>100 Men vs 1 Gorilla</strong> is the ultimate playground for unhinged voice chat, inside jokes, and legendary moments you\u2019ll be quoting for weeks. Bring friends\u2014or strangers\u2014and let the absurdity go viral. One thing is for sure, you're not leaving without a story (or a clip).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b138917b086103bbbf938d0de26af318.poster.avif?t=1750034416\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b138917b086103bbbf938d0de26af318.webm?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/b138917b086103bbbf938d0de26af318.mp4?t=1750034416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A quick word from our participants:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/f13f92800824c77adb2a30692a8030c7.avif?t=1750034416\" width=100 height=100 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Ooh ooh aah aah!&quot;</strong> \u2013 Gorilla<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715540/extras/71c098dd364d77c61866c43fd53cfc4d.avif?t=1750034416\" width=100 height=100 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;It's really fun to fight the Gorilla with 99 other people&quot;</strong> \u2013 Regular guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
